    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Team_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Team Feats\">Team Feats</a></i></p><p>You and your allies are excellent pilots whose skills shine when you fly together, making you better as a unit than as individuals.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +3 competence bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> checks. At the time you make a check, for each ally within 12 squares of you who also has this Feat, the competence bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +7).</p><p>Additionally, you always succeed when trying to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Avoid_Collision\" title=\"Avoid Collision\">Avoid Collision</a> with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a> piloted by allies who also have this Feat (no <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Collisions\" title=\"Collisions\">Collisions</a> occur, even on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Character_Scale\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Character Scale\">Character Scale</a>).</p>",
